      "file": "src/tools/ftfuzzer/ftfuzzer.cc",
      "function": "LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput",
      "line": 349,
      "code": "if ( instance_index == 0 )\n  setIntermediateAxis( face );",
      "note": "After `FT_New_Memory_Face` accepts the font and the harness is exercising the default instance (`instance_index == 0`), it enters the variable-font path by calling `setIntermediateAxis(face)`. The saved crash stack confirms this path reaches `TT_Get_MM_Var`.",
      "oracle_kind": "gt_parser_checkpoint",
      "kind": "parser_admitted"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sfnt/sfobjs.c",
      "function": "sfnt_init_face",
      "line": 967,
      "code": "if ( face->goto_table( face, TTAG_fvar, stream, &fvar_len ) ||\n     fvar_len < 20                                          ||\n     FT_READ_ULONG( version )                               ||\n     FT_READ_USHORT( offset )                               ||\n     FT_STREAM_SKIP( 2 ) /* reserved */                     ||\n     FT_READ_USHORT( num_axes )                             ||\n     FT_READ_USHORT( axis_size )                            ||\n     FT_READ_USHORT( num_instances )                        ||\n     FT_READ_USHORT( instance_size ) )",
      "note": "First vulnerability-relevant project parser statement. It reads the attacker-controlled `fvar` header into local fields, including the font's named-instance count, and the valid-header path immediately below sets `face->variation_support |= TT_FACE_FLAG_VAR_FVAR`.",
      "kind": "source"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sfnt/sfobjs.c",
      "function": "sfnt_init_face",
      "line": null,
      "code": "if ( !face->goto_table( face, TTAG_CFF, stream, 0 ) )\n  num_instances = 0;",
      "note": "Root cause. The vulnerable code treats the mere presence of a `CFF ` table as grounds to discard the parsed `fvar` named-instance count, even when the same font also contains `glyf` and should still use the TrueType variation path. The fix changes this condition to zero the count only when `glyf` is absent and `CFF ` is present, and it moves the check after the default-instance synthesis block.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sfnt/sfobjs.c",
      "function": "sfnt_init_face",
      "line": 1003,
      "code": "if ( !face->goto_table( face, TTAG_CFF, stream, 0 ) )\n  num_instances = 0;",
